# SM Payroll System — Deep Analysis Report

> **Project**: SM Payroll & Workforce Management System  
> **Target Sector**: Indian Manufacturing / Service / Construction / Sales  
> **Analysis Date**: 24 May 2026

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend["Frontend (React 18 + Vite + TypeScript)"]
        Pages["65+ Pages"]
        Stores["38 Zustand Stores"]
        Components["42+ Components"]
        Hooks["14 Custom Hooks"]
        Utils["23 Utility Modules"]
        I18N["10-Language i18n"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend (Express.js + Node.js)"]
        API["12 API Route Files"]
        Auth["JWT + bcrypt Auth"]
        RBAC["Role-Based Access Control"]
        Cron["Cron Scheduler"]
        Workers["Worker Threads"]
    end

    subgraph Database["Database (Sequelize ORM)"]
        SQLite["SQLite (Dev)"]
        Postgres["PostgreSQL (Prod/Render)"]
        Models["31 Data Models"]
    end

    subgraph Mobile["Mobile & PWA"]
        Capacitor["Capacitor (Android)"]
        PWA["PWA Install Prompt"]
        GPS["Background GPS"]
        FaceAPI["face-api.js Biometrics"]
    end

    Frontend --> Backend --> Database
    Frontend --> Mobile
```

| Layer | Tech | Key Details |
|-------|------|-------------|
| **Frontend** | React 18 + Vite + TypeScript | TailwindCSS, Lucide Icons, Framer Motion, Recharts, jsPDF |
| **State** | Zustand | 38 stores, auto-sync every 30s |
| **Backend** | Express.js | 1,161-line monolith [index.js](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/server/index.js) + 12 route modules |
| **Database** | Sequelize ORM | SQLite (dev) / PostgreSQL (prod), 31 models |
| **Mobile** | Capacitor 8 | Android build, background geolocation, face scan |
| **Auth** | JWT + bcrypt | Refresh tokens, rate limiting, brute-force lockout, IP restrictions |
| **i18n** | i18next | EN, HI, BN, UR, AR, ES, FR, PT, RU, ZH |

