## 3. Payroll Engine Deep-Dive

The salary calculator at [salaryCalculator.ts](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/src/utils/salaryCalculator.ts) (411 lines) handles:

| Calculation | Formula/Logic |
|-------------|---------------|
| **Basic Salary** | [(BasicSalary / TotalWorkDays) × PresentDays](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/src/App.tsx#138-328) (with paid leave counted) |
| **Overtime** | [(Basic/WorkDays) × OT_Hours × 1.5](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/src/App.tsx#138-328) |
| **Production** | Sum of approved `qty × rate` entries |
| **Deductions** | Loan EMI + Advance Recovery + PF + ESI + TDS + PT |
| **Net Salary** | `Gross - TotalDeductions` |

**Salary Types Supported**: MONTHLY, DAILY, PER_UNIT, WEEKLY, OTHER

**Payroll Statuses**: DRAFT → SIMULATION → FINAL_APPROVED → LOCKED

