## 4. RBAC & Permissions System

**5 Roles**: `SUPER_ADMIN` > `ADMIN` > `ACCOUNT_ADMIN` > `MANAGER` > `EMPLOYEE`

**90+ Granular Permissions** across: Company, Employees, Attendance, Payroll, Loans, Leaves, Production, Sales, Finance, Reports, Statutory, Settings, Admin, Approvals, Calculators

**Backend Enforcement**: [requireRole()](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/server/rbac.js#1-15) + [requireCompanyScope()](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/server/rbac.js#16-46) middleware for cross-tenant isolation

