## 5. 🚨 Missing Features & Gaps

### Critical Missing (Must-Have for Commercial)

| # | Feature | Impact | Difficulty |
|---|---------|--------|------------|
| 1 | **Email/SMS/WhatsApp Notifications** | WhatsApp service exists ([whatsappService.ts](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/src/utils/whatsappService.ts)) but no real integration — all "simulated" | Medium |
| 2 | **Payment Gateway Integration** | No bank transfer / UPI / NEFT payroll disbursement | High |
| 3 | **Document Management** | No employee document upload (Aadhaar, PAN, certificates) — only schema fields exist | Medium |
| 4 | **ESI/PF Return File Generation** | Statutory models exist but no actual government-format file exports (ECR, ESIC Return) | High |
| 5 | **Actual Email Delivery for Reports** | [scheduler.js](file:///d:/Projects/SM%20PAYROLL%20SYSTEM/server/scheduler.js) says "📧 Simulated sending" — SMTP not configured | Low |
| 6 | **Comprehensive Testing** | Only 3 test files in `src/tests/`, 1 e2e test. Coverage is ≈5% | Medium |
| 7 | **API Documentation** | No Swagger/OpenAPI docs for 12 route files | Low |
| 8 | **Database Migrations** | Using `sequelize.sync({ alter })` — no proper migration files | Medium |

### Important Missing (Competitive Edge)

| # | Feature | Why It Matters |
|---|---------|----------------|
| 9 | **Employee Self-Service Portal** | Employees can't request leaves/loans via mobile natively — only admin-driven |
| 10 | **Payroll Approval Workflow** | No maker-checker for payroll finalization — single-click generation |
| 11 | **Tax Declaration / Investment Proof Collection** | Form 16 generator exists but no HRA/80C/80D declaration intake |
| 12 | **Biometric Hardware Integration** | Face-api.js works in browser — no physical fingerprint/face reader support |
| 13 | **Attendance Regularization Workflow** | `regularizationStore.ts` exists (1.3KB) but barely functional |
| 14 | **Overtime Policy Engine** | Fixed 1.5x multiplier — no configurable OT policies (weekly cap, double-time, etc.) |
| 15 | **Multi-Currency Support** | INR only — no multi-currency for international clients |
| 16 | **Employee Separation/Offboarding** | No FnF (Full & Final Settlement) flow — status changes to INACTIVE only |

