## 9. Database Structure Suggestions

### Current Issues

| Problem | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **No Foreign Keys** | Models reference each other by string IDs with no actual FK constraints |
| **JSON Columns Overused** | `bankDetails`, `leaveBalance`, `ledger`, `auditTrail`, `photos`, `tags` all stored as JSON — not queryable |
| **No Indexes on Key Queries** | Only `Attendance(employeeId, date)`, `AuditLog(companyId, timestamp)`, and `Client(companyId)` are indexed |
| **Date Strings, Not DATE Type** | `date`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `issuedDate` are all STRING — no date-range queries |
| **No Soft Delete** | `softDeleteManager.ts` exists but models have no `deletedAt` column |
| **No Database Versioning** | Using `sync({ alter })` in production — risky for schema changes |

### Recommended Schema Enhancements

```sql
-- Missing Tables Needed for Enterprise
CREATE TABLE Documents (id, employeeId, type, fileName, fileUrl, uploadedAt, verifiedBy);
CREATE TABLE Announcements (id, companyId, title, body, targetRole, publishedAt, expiresAt);
CREATE TABLE FullFinalSettlement (id, employeeId, separationDate, reason, components JSON, status);
CREATE TABLE TaxDeclarations (id, employeeId, financialYear, section, amount, proofUrl, status);
CREATE TABLE PayrollBatch (id, companyId, month, status, generatedBy, approvedBy, lockedAt);
CREATE TABLE BankPaymentFile (id, batchId, format, fileUrl, bankName, status);
CREATE TABLE AssetAssignment (id, employeeId, assetType, serialNo, issuedDate, returnDate);
CREATE TABLE TrainingRecord (id, employeeId, course, completedDate, certificate);
```

