## 11. Commercial Product Roadmap

### What Type of Payroll Software Can This Become?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> SM Payroll is uniquely positioned for the **Indian SMB Manufacturing + Construction + Field Sales** segment — a heavily underserved market in India.

```mermaid
graph TB
    Current["🏗️ Current: Internal Tool<br/>SM Builders Use Only"] --> V1
    V1["📦 v1.0: SaaS for Indian SMBs<br/>50-500 employees<br/>₹999-₹4999/month"] --> V2
    V2["🏢 v2.0: Mid-Market ERP<br/>500-5000 employees<br/>₹9999-₹49999/month"] --> V3
    V3["🌐 v3.0: Enterprise Platform<br/>Multi-country, API marketplace<br/>Custom pricing"]
```

### Target Market Segments

| Segment | Size (India) | Why SM Payroll Fits |
|---------|-------------|---------------------|
| **Construction Companies** | 12M+ firms | Production tracking, piece-rate, daily wage, GPS attendance |
| **Manufacturing Units** | 6.3M+ MSMEs | Work groups, piece-rate, shift management, overtime |
| **Field Sales Teams** | Millions | CRM module, GPS tracking, client visits, geo-fencing |
| **Service Companies** | Growing | Attendance, leaves, basic payroll |

### Competitive Comparison

| Feature | SM Payroll | Zoho Payroll | GreytHR | Keka |
|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|------|
| Production/Piece-Rate | ✅ Built-in | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Face Scan Attendance | ✅ Browser-based | ❌ | Add-on | Add-on |
| GPS Geo-fenced Punch | ✅ | Add-on | Add-on | ✅ |
| Salesman CRM | ✅ Built-in | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Multi-language (10) | ✅ | Limited | Limited | Limited |
| On-premise Option | ✅ SQLite | ❌ Cloud-only | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Price** | **Free/Self-hosted** | ₹60/emp/mo | ₹75/emp/mo | ₹100/emp/mo |

### USP (Unique Selling Points)
1. **Production + Payroll in One** — No other payroll software has built-in piece-rate tracking
2. **Offline-First Design** — PWA + Capacitor works in poor connectivity areas (factory floors, construction sites)
3. **Self-Hosted Option** — SQLite mode means zero server cost for small firms
4. **Bilingual by Default** — Hindi/Urdu/Bengali for blue-collar workforce

